## Do not

- Submit a second `-f moq` to ffmpeg.git. FFmpeg will not accept two muxers named `moq`. Protocol `moq:` does not take that name.
- Pipe canary encode through hang / moq-lite / `moq-cli`.
- Force-push, terraform-apply new VMs, or hard-refresh playa vendor with `FORCE=1` unless the catalog-version + `initDataList` flatten is preserved.

